  "question": {
    "text": "A <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>&nbsp;charge is divided into two parts and placed at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> distance so that the repulsive force between them is maximum. The charges of the two parts are:",
